"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Despite the numerous challenges he has overcome so far, Shidou Itsuka's mission with Ratatoskr is far from over. In a departure from his daily routine, Shidou encounters a starving woman lying on the street and ends up helping her. After the two arrive at her apartment, the woman introduces herself as Nia Honjou—a popular manga artist working under a pen name. However, cutting straight to the chase, Nia reveals that she is also a Spirit and is aware of Shidou's secret operation.\n\nInterested in seeing his charisma firsthand, Nia challenges Shidou to win her over on a date. As he strives for an opportunity to seal her powers, Shidou learns more about Nia and her history with Deus Ex Machina Industries, a name he is all too familiar with...\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Harem","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Memory Manipulation","rank":76,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Space","rank":72,"spoiler":true},{"name":"CGI","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":67,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Parody","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yandere","rank":56,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fairy Tale","rank":48,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":46,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ghost","rank":43,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":43,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Idol","rank":40,"spoiler"